    "summary": "Equestrian figure; lost-wax cast in brass. Male figure wearing elaborate feathered headdress with upright finial. Dressed in skin armour, with short-sleeved patterned garment below, enormous beaded ruff-like collar, beaded forehead band, leather armbands and spurs. Holds bridle in left hand and spear in right; plaited cane shield on left side. Horse stands on hollow rectangular pedestal base decorated around sides with interlace patterns.",
